art 1: Swimming 12 miles at 2 mph**\n\n$$\n\\text{Time}_1 = \\frac{12}{2} = 6 \\text{ hours}\n$$\n\n#### **Part 2: Resting for half as long as the swimming time**\n\n$$\n\\text{Rest time} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 6 = 3 \\text{ hours}\n$$\n\n#### **Part 3: Swimming 8 miles at half the speed**\n\n- Half of 2 mph = 1 mph  \n$$\n\\text{Time}_2 = \\frac{8}{1} = 8 \\text{ hours}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 3: Total time**\n\n$$\n\\text{Total time} = \\text{Time}_1 + \\text{Rest time} + \\text{Time}_2 = 6 + 3 + 8 = \\boxed{17 \\text{ hours}}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{17} \\text{ hours}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 10.96859082300216, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 115, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "21a6c8c6bb71c118df4f7100b07765f272c9eb4c0b2ee2ee1a0b317c97d651c2", "output_tokens": 401, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20561935872, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20893925376, "problem_id": "gsm8k/fb9167f06dd28b30", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 11003.003429155797}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "17", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 11.003003429155797, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20893925376, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20893925376, "sampling_seed": 774923633940589261, "sampling_temperature": 0.6, "target_calls": 401, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.03303005825728178, "turn_index": 0}
