oe starts with **$50**.\n\n- **Money left:**  \n  $$\n  50 - 42 = 8\n  $$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 **Final Answer:**\n$$\n\\boxed{8}\n$$\n\nJoe will have **$8 left** after the purchase.", "decode_seconds": 8.734707992058247, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 100, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "832eb809b443108339e6e93a5334207f1ae1cc096fa2eb01d36b54c3922c25ae", "output_tokens": 319, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20518130176, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20893925376, "problem_id": "gsm8k/6315aebb3eed1425", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 8769.027631729841}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "8", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 8.769027631729841, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20893925376, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20893925376, "sampling_seed": 3990875968535835101, "sampling_temperature": 0.6, "target_calls": 319, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.03285661805421114, "turn_index": 0}
{"acceptance_length": 4.857142857142857, "acceptance_lengths": [3, 6, 1, 3, 2, 4, 7, 4, 2, 1, 5, 1, 4, 3, 10, 2, 3, 3, 1, 10, 4, 1, 2, 4, 5, 1, 2, 6, 1, 1, 1, 3, 11, 3, 7, 12, 15, 9, 3, 11, 16, 4, 6, 16, 10, 3, 1, 3, 3, 3, 9, 4, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 3, 3, 9, 3, 6, 5, 2, 10, 9, 14, 8, 6], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 20455006208, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 20454988800, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "Let's break this down step by step to find out how much money Joe will have left after buying the outfit.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 1: Understand the discounts and prices**\n\n- **Joe has $50.**\n- There is a **30% off sale** at the store.\n- **Shirt price: $25**\n- **Shorts price: $35**\n\nSince the sale is **30% off**, the discount applies to the **total price** of the items Joe is buying.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 2: Calculate the total price before discount**\n\n$$\n\\text{Total price before discount} = 25 + 35 = 60\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 3: Apply the 30% discount**\n\n$$\n\\text{Discount amount} = 30\\% \\times 60 = 0.30 \\times 60 = 18\n$$\n\n$$\n\\text{Price after discount} = 60 - 18 = 42\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 4: Add sales tax (if any)**\n\nThe problem says **\"assuming that sales tax is included\"**, so we don't need to add or calculate tax separately \u2014 the $42 already includes the tax.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 5: Subtract the total cost from Joe's money**\n\n$$\n\\text{Money left} = 50 - 42 = 8\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 **Final Answer:**\n\n$$\n\\boxed{8}\n$$\n\nJoe will have **$8 left** after the purchase.", "decode_seconds": 2.5560539760626853, "draft_calls": 70, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 100, "method": "native_target_dflash", "output_hash": "d0c4d73bc5af18ea38f56a5e3a595789224819b41b328642b50c10078038d759", "output_tokens": 339, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20560245248, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20893925376, "problem_id": "gsm8k/6315aebb3eed1425", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 2595.8233918063343}, "rank": 0, "refer